			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-402125">
									

<p>At the time, I felt the definitions of "Safe" and "Euclid" as used by the foundation seemed a little vague. After all, if everything that "contains mechanisms that are foreign to humans, and display erratic or seemingly impossible behaviours" is supposed to be Euclid, doesn't that include just about every single SCP there is?</p>
